msgid "Postal code (for shipping)"
msgstr "Pašto kodas (pristatymui)"

msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "Profiliai"

msgid "Connecting profile on the supports"
msgstr "Jungiamasis profilis ant atramų"

msgid "On every beam"
msgstr "Ant kiekvienos sijos"

msgid "On every rafter"
msgstr "Ant kiekvienos atramos"

msgid "Optimal"
msgstr "Optimalus"

msgid "Optimal covers as much of the chosen width as it can. Each joint still sits on a rafter."
msgstr "Optimalus uždengia tiek pasirinkto pločio, kiek galima. Kiekviena jungtis vis tiek yra ant atramos."

msgid "Each sheet covers as much of the chosen width as it can. A joint is used only where the sheets meet, and it still sits on a rafter."
msgstr "Kiekvienas lakštas uždengia tiek pasirinkto pločio, kiek galima. Jungtis naudojama tik ten, kur lakštai susitinka, ir ji vis tiek yra ant atramos."

#, php-format
msgid "Only where sheets meet, using up to %d mm"
msgstr "Tik ten, kur lakštai susiduria, iki %d mm"

msgid "A joint always sits on the centre of a beam. The second choice lets one sheet span several beams, cut from the standard sheet width."
msgstr "Siūlė visada yra sijos centre. Antras pasirinkimas leidžia vienam lakštui dengti kelias sijas, pjaunant iš standartinio pločio."

